    {
        "content": "<p>Hi, it should be because this action has many parameters, and consequently the <code>Veil.Enumeration</code> instance to be synthesized will be big, but Lean by default does not synthesize too large instances. Using <code>set_option synthInstance.maxSize 20000</code> (here 20000 is just a large number, you can make it even larger) to increase the default size 4096 to 20000 should resolve this issue.</p>",
        "id": 578167596,
        "sender_full_name": "Qiyuan Zhao",
        "timestamp": 1773065523
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Got it. Thanks for the response!</p>",
